    &lt;/StackPanel&gt;
&lt;/Grid&gt;
In MainWindow.axaml.cs, set the DataContext in the constructor as shown above.

✅ Check. The window shows Hello, stranger!. Now type your name: the greeting does not change. That is not a mistake in your code. Read on to see why.
